17 | string $got = @Risky::read("x");
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ there is nothing here to suppress
   = help: a failure is a `Throwable` propagated by checked return, not a diagnostic printed beside a value — catch it with `try`/`catch`

